## 1. Main Entry Point / Server Startup

This repository has **two server components** -- a TypeScript-based MCP-Auto-Server (the main MCP server) and a Python-based automation agent (the `mcp-auto` directory).

### Primary MCP Server (TypeScript/Node.js)

- **`/home/silimon/MCP-Auto/MCP-Auto-Server/src/index.ts`** -- This is the main entry point. It:
  - Parses CLI arguments (`--mcpServerConfigDir`, `--serverPath`, `--pythonPath`)
  - Creates a `FilteredStdioServerTransport` for stdio-based MCP communication
  - Instantiates the `server` from `server.ts`, loads config via `configManager`, and connects the transport
