## Summary

This is **MCP-Auto**, an automated MCP server deployment agent by Silimon001. Its architecture is:

1. **`MCP-Auto-Server/`** (TypeScript) -- The main MCP server exposing tools (`add_config`, `execute_command`, `validate_config`, etc.) via stdio transport using the raw `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`
